# 📖 Description

The *Smart Medical & Psychological Assessment Platform* is a JavaFX-based desktop application designed to assist healthcare professionals, psychologists, administrators, and patients in managing psychological assessments, medical records, appointments, and AI-powered insights.

The platform combines modern desktop technologies with Artificial Intelligence services to provide an intelligent and interactive healthcare experience.

## 🎯 Project Goals

* Simplify psychological test management
* Centralize patient medical information
* Provide intelligent AI-generated psychological insights
* Improve appointment scheduling and monitoring
* Generate professional reports and analytics
* Offer a modern and user-friendly desktop interface

## 👥 Target Users

* Administrators
* Psychologists
* Patients
* Healthcare staff

## ✨ Main Features

### 🔐 Authentication & User Management

* Secure login and registration
* Password hashing and authentication
* User role management
* Profile management

### 🧠 Psychological Testing

* Interactive psychological tests
* Dynamic result calculation
* AI-assisted analysis of responses
* Behavioral insight generation

### 🏥 Medical Records

* Patient medical history management
* Data validation and organization
* Medical record consultation

### 📅 Appointment Management

* Schedule appointments
* Manage availability
* Appointment tracking and organization

### 📄 Reports & Analytics

* PDF report generation
* Parent reports
* Session analysis
* Statistical visualization

### 🤖 Artificial Intelligence Integration

* OpenAI integration
* Gemini AI integration
* Grok AI integration
* Automated psychological insights

