# 🚀 Installation & Setup

## 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/your-username/your-repository.git
cd your-repository

---

## 2️⃣ Configure the Database

Create a MySQL database:

CREATE DATABASE smart_medical_platform;

Update your database configuration inside the service classes:

private static final String URL = "jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/emonado";
private static final String USER = "root";
private static final String PASSWORD = "root";

---

## 3️⃣ Install Dependencies

mvn clean install

---

## 4️⃣ Configure AI API Keys

Add your API keys inside the corresponding service files:

### OpenAI

private static final String API_KEY = "YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY";

### Gemini

private static final String API_KEY = "YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY";

### Grok

private static final String API_KEY = "YOUR_GROK_API_KEY";

⚠️ Never expose your API keys publicly.

---

## 5️⃣ Run the Application

mvn javafx:run

Or run the main JavaFX application directly from IntelliJ IDEA.

